# Noxentra Core Rules

- Follow `AGENTS.md` for architecture and commands.
- Run Python tools through `uv run --group dev ...` and verify changes with `./scripts/check.sh`.
- Use list-form `subprocess` calls; avoid `shell=True`, `curl | bash`, or forced `sudo`.
- Use `constants.USER_CONFIG_DIR` (`~/.noxentra`) instead of hardcoding home paths; store secrets only in `~/.noxentra/.env` (mode `0600`).
- After modifying any GitHub URL in `src/noxentra/`, regenerate `src/noxentra/catalog_owners.py` with `uv run python scripts/gen_catalog_owners.py`.
